  "source_parent": "68500896e179ae0d6bdc3b260c8d0c6fb4475eaf",
  "scope": "Simplify run-trace head-step bounds",
  "validation": "Paired target and ArithmeticTilingTable direct-client builds pass using the prior source-current WangPlane provider. All 79 target and 73 client namespace declaration/type/axiom reports match, as do 29,730 default simp and 13,383 instance entries. Paired client probes pin both target and client objects.",
  "limitations": [
    "The baseline and selected ArithmeticTilingTable object hashes differ for an undetermined reason; matching interface and registration probes do not establish identical compiled proof terms or every environment extension.",
    "The sole direct source importer found under Computability/DiophantineConsistency/Lean is ArithmeticTilingTable. Other transitive clients and environment extensions remain outside checked scope.",
    "An initial setup build failed because a BusyBeaver provider path was absent; its source, structured receipt, log and time are preserved. Plain simp on the lower bound also failed; its source/log/status are preserved without a full hash receipt.",
    "The superseded simp [le_tsub_add] variant compiled but added public generated le_hstep._simp_1; the selected alternate does not. Earlier exploratory and selected-target provisional object paths were later reused, so their old output objects are not independently retained.",
    "Two initial independent-audit runs failed, one on a log-text assertion and one on a pre-commit baseline/workspace comparison; their logs are retained and the corrected post-commit audit passes. A later audit-script filename collision was corrected and the final audit rerun successfully; these script-only issues did not alter Lean builds.",
    "The source-current direct WangPlane provider has a prior receipt but its project, BusyBeaver, Foundation and Mathlib transitive closure is cached. One shared-load timing pair is not a general benchmark. Compiled objects are not archived; live external objects are required for independent byte checks."
  ],
  "archive": "inputs-and-logs.zip",
